    "text": "<p><img src=\"assets\\st0167_6cbdfad4e204.png\" style=\"width: 341px; height: 262px;\" /></p><p>Loop ABCD</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>abI</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>(</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>)</mo></math><br />For Loop DEFA <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>abI</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>(</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>)</mo></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><msub><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>;</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>b</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>(</mo><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>)</mo></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mi>a</mi><mi>b</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi></math> along <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math>.</p>"
